{"id": "baitu-ji-100", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 100, "start": 3229.8, "end": 3254.0, "durationSec": 24.2, "text": "奉懿旨承父命快马追风", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-101", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 101, "start": 3286.1, "end": 3297.2, "durationSec": 11.1, "text": "旌旗奋战马嘶雪满雕弓", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-102", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 102, "start": 3300.0, "end": 3310.7, "durationSec": 10.7, "text": "我父帅刘知远接旨颁令", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-106", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 106, "start": 3542.5, "end": 3543.499, "durationSec": 0.999, "text": "日担水夜挨磨一十六年", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-110", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 110, "start": 3601.3, "end": 3611.499, "durationSec": 10.199, "text": "十六年，玉桂树老叶飘零一", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-117", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 117, "start": 3711.5, "end": 3724.399, "durationSec": 12.899, "text": "好似那，娇儿回到娘身边", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-126", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 126, "start": 3974.4, "end": 3986.7, "durationSec": 12.3, "text": "为什么，心发颤热泪盈眶", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-128", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 128, "start": 4008.6, "end": 4011.4, "durationSec": 2.8, "text": "请问妇", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-13", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 13, "start": 365.8, "end": 376.7, "durationSec": 10.9, "text": "欲报刘郎莫中计 心急如焚步似飞", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-131", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 131, "start": 4019.7, "end": 4023.6, "durationSec": 3.9, "text": "这幼免离娘怀遍体鳞伤", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-134", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 134, "start": 4028.3, "end": 4041.099, "durationSec": 12.799, "text": "就像我那失散的爱子咬脐郎", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-150", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 150, "start": 4173.2, "end": 4177.2, "durationSec": 4.0, "text": "思念我那失散的孩儿咬脐郎", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-155", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 155, "start": 4190.3, "end": 4191.4, "durationSec": 1.1, "text": "咬脐郎啊咬脐郎，你如今流落在何方？", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-159", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 159, "start": 4223.3, "end": 4225.3, "durationSec": 2.0, "text": "从不知民间苦令人惨伤", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-169", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 169, "start": 4268.7, "end": 4273.099, "durationSec": 4.399, "text": "十六年忘却生身母", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-17", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 17, "start": 929.5, "end": 940.0, "durationSec": 10.5, "text": "为知远强忍泪泪落胸膛", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-170", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 170, "start": 4273.1, "end": 4277.3, "durationSec": 4.2, "text": "十六年不传家书到村庄", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-172", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 172, "start": 4283.1, "end": 4296.199, "durationSec": 13.099, "text": "劝妇人，休悲伤，我狩猎归去细查访", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-176", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 176, "start": 4465.8, "end": 4488.799, "durationSec": 22.999, "text": "松筠带雪研，寒侵指尖", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-191", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 191, "start": 4589.7, "end": 4596.3, "durationSec": 6.6, "text": "十六年后容颜变，八千里外客心安", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-197", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 197, "start": 4626.1, "end": 4627.0, "durationSec": 0.9, "text": "书去一月如一秋，书去三月泪已千", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-21", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 21, "start": 964.6, "end": 971.399, "durationSec": 6.799, "text": "嫁一个腰缠万贯如意郎", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-214", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 214, "start": 4973.9, "end": 5002.599, "durationSec": 28.699, "text": "玉兔信物挂胸前，襁褓血写咬脐郎", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-220", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 220, "start": 5043.9, "end": 5057.699, "durationSec": 13.799, "text": "宽慰我，半世坎坷心头伤", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-232", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 232, "start": 5500.5, "end": 5506.699, "durationSec": 6.199, "text": "送玉兔，归还信物了旧情", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-233", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 233, "start": 5506.7, "end": 5511.199, "durationSec": 4.499, "text": "时过境迁十六年，想不到", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-241", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 241, "start": 5644.8, "end": 5650.899, "durationSec": 6.099, "text": "儿为你牵马坠蹬回家来", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-244", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 244, "start": 5661.1, "end": 5670.3, "durationSec": 9.2, "text": "爹爹呀，你自幼教我识礼仪", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-25", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 25, "start": 1004.6, "end": 1009.799, "durationSec": 5.199, "text": "我不是 朝秦暮楚的青楼女", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-254", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 254, "start": 5927.7, "end": 5933.799, "durationSec": 6.099, "text": "我何尝不哀伤泪湿战袍", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-259", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 259, "start": 5965.9, "end": 5971.699, "durationSec": 5.799, "text": "可怜她，未做夫人先做娘", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
{"id": "baitu-ji-260", "pieceId": "baitu-ji", "title": "白兔记", "audio": "assets/audio/baitu-ji.m4a", "cueId": 260, "start": 5971.7, "end": 5978.399, "durationSec": 6.699, "text": "日夜贴你在怀抱", "zhStatus": "corrected", "speaker": null, "split": "test", "register": null, "goldOk": true, "rights": "archive-starter", "notes": ""}
